  "worked_solution": "- To find the value of $a,$ we substitute $t=-1$ into $x=4t.$ This gives\n\n$$\na=4(-1)=-4.\n$$\n\n- To find the value of $b,$ we substitute $t=0$ into $x=4t.$ This gives\n\n$$\nb=4(0)=0.\n$$\n\n- To find the value of $c,$ we substitute $t=1$ into $y=-{t}^{3}.$ This gives\n\n$$\nc=-(1)^{3}=-1.\n$$\n\nFinally, we have\n\n$$\na+b+c=-4+0+(-1)=-5.\n$$",
